{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52432","headline":"回波乐 七十五 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生死如流星，涓涓向前去。\n前死万年余，寻入微尘数。\n中死千年外，骨石化爲土。\n後死百年强，形骸在坟墓。\n续续死将埋，地窄无安处。\n已後烧作灰，扬却随风去。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}